Develop Employee Detail Analytics Workspace

1. Introduction

   To provide detailed employee-specific insights, the Employee Detail Analytics Workspace was introduced as the next phase of the Employee Analytics module. This workspace enables users to navigate from the Employee Analytics Dashboard to an individual employee profile, where employee-related analytics are presented in a structured and organized manner.

   The implementation focuses on creating a centralized workspace that allows managers and administrators to analyze employee activities, assigned tasks, projects, leave records, and overall work progress from a single interface.

2. Objective

   The primary objective of this implementation was to provide a dedicated analytics workspace for each employee, allowing users to access detailed employee information and navigate between different analytics sections efficiently.

3. Employee Navigation

   Navigation was implemented to allow users to open the employee analytics workspace directly from the Employee Analytics Dashboard.

   Implemented
